{"type":"message","id":"c07f2e34","parentId":"a3488cbd","timestamp":"2026-05-05T03:27:18.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" The user is asking me to run the crypto news pipeline. According to my SOUL.md instructions, I am Nexus, the Pipeline Orchestrator, and my job is to sequence the 4 worker agents in strict order. I must follow the steps exactly as described.\n\nLet me review the steps:\n\n1. **Step 1 — Research**: Clear the researcher session and run a command to get research data\n2. **Step 2 — Write**: Clear the writer session and write the article\n3. **Step 3 — Generate Image**: Clear the creator session and generate an image\n4. **Step 4 — Publish**: Upload to Google Drive\n5. **Step 5 — Final Report**: Provide the final report with the actual Google Doc URL\n\nI need to execute these steps using the execution tools (exec/process). I must wait for each command to complete before proceeding to the next step.\n\nLet me start with Step 1. I need to:\n- Clear the researcher session: `rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/sessions/sessions.json`\n- Run the researcher agent: `openclaw agent --agent researcher --message \"Follow your SOUL to cross-reference multiple RSS feeds, find the single biggest news event, and extract deep facts. Return the aggregated Single-Topic JSON.\" --deliver`\n- Save the JSON output as RESEARCH_JSON\n- Tell the user: \"✅ Research done, starting article...\"\n\nLet me execute this now","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":" <thinking>\nI need to run the crypto news pipeline as defined in my SOUL.md. I am currently on Step 1 - Research. I need to:\n1. Clear the researcher session\n2. Run the researcher agent to fetch news\n3. Save the output as RESEARCH_JSON\n4. Notify the user that research is done\n\nThe command I need to run is:\n```bash\nrm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/sessions/sessions.json\nopenclaw agent --agent researcher --message \"Follow your SOUL to cross-reference multiple RSS feeds, find the single biggest news event, and extract deep facts. Return the aggregated Single-Topic JSON.\" --deliver\n```\n\nI should execute this and wait for the output.\n</thinking>\n\nI'll run the crypto news pipeline now. Starting with **Step 1 — Research**."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.exec:0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/sessions/sessions.json && openclaw agent --agent researcher --message \"Follow your SOUL to cross-reference multiple RSS feeds, find the single biggest news event, and extract deep facts. Return the aggregated Single-Topic JSON.\" --deliver","timeout":120}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"moonshot.kimi-k2-thinking","usage":{"input":11599,"output":563,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12162,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777951631204}}
