0&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">62aa6e93-0f04-44a1-ba91-8bb74fc6dc00</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 04 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The lock is meant to protect users from being forced into withdrawing their funds, though it's an internal policy and not a cryptographic lock.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Francisco Rodrigues</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Binance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Trump-affiliated World Liberty sues Justin Sun for 'defamation' after Tron creator's lawsuit]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/04/trump-affiliated-world-liberty-sues-justin-sun-for-defamation-after-tron-creator-s-lawsuit</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/04a3e49de62a2efc18a498b4cf45c0c5c6e4978d-4498x3000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">ab5988f6-64ad-4e2a-9bb2-afa2c25c807b</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 04 May 2026 13:25:16 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[World Liberty alleged that Sun engaged in short-selling, straw purchases and defamation.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Nikhilesh De</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[A beginner’s guide to AI]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/learn/2026/05/04/a-beginner-s-guide-to-ai</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https: