{"type":"message","id":"0eaa070b","parentId":"61d4c17a","timestamp":"2026-05-05T03:33:07.046Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.exec:8","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agents:\n- main (default)\n  Identity: 📰 Lex (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\n  Routing: default (no explicit rules)\n- orchestrator\n  Identity: 🎯 Nexus (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/orchestrator/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\n- researcher\n  Identity: 🔍 Scout (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace-researcher\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\n- writer\n  Identity: ✍️ Quill (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace-writer\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/writer/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\n- creator\n  Identity: 🎨 Pixel (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/creator/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\n- publisher\n  Identity: 📤 Press (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace-publisher\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/publisher/agent\n  Model: amazon-bedrock/mistral.mistral-large-3-675b-instruct\n  Routing rules: 0\nRouting rules map channel/account/peer to an agent. Use --bindings for full rules.\nChannel status reflects local config/creds. For live health: openclaw channels status --probe."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5266,"aggregated":"Agents:\n- main (default)\n  Identity: 📰 Lex (IDENTITY.md)\n  Workspace: ~/.openclaw/workspace\n  Agent dir: ~/.openclaw/agents/main/agent\n