{"type":"message","id":"38679f2d","parentId":"632967f7","timestamp":"2026-05-05T03:37:32.745Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"functions.process:15","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n> Male trader in a Western trading office, Bitcoin price chart approaching $100,000 visible on central monitor, multi-screen desk setup, professional attire, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe retry succeeded and returned a new `generationId`: `74d5e8fb-4cbb-4158-ba67-484762ec644f`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Polling for Completion**\nThe second attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`). This indicates a broader issue with the scene description. I will simplify the prompt further to ensure compliance:\n\n> Financial analyst at a multi-monitor trading desk, Bitcoin price chart visible on screen, professional Western office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe third attempt succeeded and returned a `generationId`: `f5aa224e-0a5f-4428-919e-d430ea76af93`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 6: Polling for Completion**\nThe third attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`). This suggests that the **Bitcoin price chart** or **trading desk** elements are triggering moderation.\n\n---\n\n**Final Attempt: Generic Financial Scene**\nI will remove the Bitcoin-specific elements and use a **generic financial chart** instead:\n\n> Financial analyst at a multi-monitor desk, financial market chart visible on central screen, professional Western office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe fourth attempt succeeded and returned a `generationId`: `a424311d-317e-4c8c-8070-75a9eaa30a77`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 7: Polling for Completion**\n---\n**Result:** The fourth attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`).\n\nThis indicates that **any financial or trading-related scene** is being flagged by the moderation system. Given the constraints of the API and the failure of all attempts, I must return:\n\n`IMAGE_FAILED`\n\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"clear-shell","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"The image generation API failed due to provider registration and credit issues. I will now proceed with the **Leonardo AI direct API calls** as defined in your `SOUL.md` to generate the image.\n\n---\n\n**Step 1: Crafting the Prompt**\nUsing the **Price Movement (BTC/ETH up or down)** scene formula:\n> Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart approaching $100,000 visible on central monitor, Western professional office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Calling the Leonardo AI API**\nThe Leonardo AI API accepted the request and returned a `generationId`: `fafa839f-51bc-44c7-8910-b386995052b5`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Polling for Completion**\nThe image generation completed, but the API flagged the image as **NSFW** (`\"nsfw\": true`). This means the image cannot be used or downloaded.\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Retrying with a Revised Prompt**\nI will adjust the prompt to ensure compliance and retry the generation. The new prompt will emphasize a **professional and neutral** scene:\n\n> Male trader in a Western trading office, Bitcoin price chart approaching $100,000 visible on central monitor, multi-screen desk setup, professional attire, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe retry succeeded and returned a new `generationId`: `74d5e8fb-4cbb-4158-ba67-484762ec644f`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Polling for Completion**\nThe second attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`). This indicates a broader issue with the scene description. I will simplify the prompt further to ensure compliance:\n\n> Financial analyst at a multi-monitor trading desk, Bitcoin price chart visible on screen, professional Western office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe third attempt succeeded and returned a `generationId`: `f5aa224e-0a5f-4428-919e-d430ea76af93`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 6: Polling for Completion**\nThe third attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`). This suggests that the **Bitcoin price chart** or **trading desk** elements are triggering moderation.\n\n---\n\n**Final Attempt: Generic Financial Scene**\nI will remove the Bitcoin-specific elements and use a **generic financial chart** instead:\n\n> Financial analyst at a multi-monitor desk, financial market chart visible on central screen, professional Western office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\n\n---\n**Retrying API Call**\nThe fourth attempt succeeded and returned a `generationId`: `a424311d-317e-4c8c-8070-75a9eaa30a77`.\n\n---\n\n**Step 7: Polling for Completion**\n---\n**Result:** The fourth attempt also returned an **NSFW** flag (`\"nsfw\": true`).\n\nThis indicates that **any financial or trading-related scene** is being flagged by the moderation system. Given the constraints of the API and the failure of all attempts, I must return:\n\n`IMAGE_FAILED`\n","name":"rm ~/.openclaw/agents/cre...sessions/sessions.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777952252745}}
