{"type":"message","id":"2dbd1530","parentId":"c6504d97","timestamp":"2026-05-05T04:38:35.238Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have the template. Now let me write a fresh article based on the new research data, following the template exactly. Let me write the article:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_oTUrHZei9XVgC4Zx448eHc","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/crypto-article.md","content":"META\n- SEO Title: Bitcoin Tests $80,000 as Western Markets Carry BTC Rally\n- Meta Description: Bitcoin hovers near $80K as Western trading desks shoulder the rally. Asian participation fades while Hong Kong AI IPOs draw capital away from crypto.\n- URL Slug: bitcoin-tests-80000-western-markets-carry-rally\n- Categories: Bitcoin News, Latest News\n- Primary Keyword: Bitcoin tests $80,000\n- Secondary Keywords: Western trading desks, Hong Kong AI IPOs, BTC ETF flows\n\n---\n\n# Bitcoin Tests $80,000 Resistance as Western Markets Shoulder the Rally Alone\n\nBitcoin trades at $80,782.59, testing the $80,000 level that has capped upside for multiple sessions. The price remains stuck below the $80,700 short-term holder realized price, a key on-chain resistance level according to Glassnode data.\n\nWestern trading desks are doing most of the heavy lifting. April timezone data from Presto Research shows Asian trading hours consistently dragged on returns. U.S. and European sessions drove nearly all the gains. This is not a coordinated global rally. It is a Western-led push meeting a wall of resistance.\n\n## Western Markets: The Lone Engine Behind Bitcoin's Rally\n\nThe data tells a clear story about regional participation. Asian bids have faded dramatically, leaving Western desks to carry the momentum alone.\n\nHong Kong's three spot Bitcoin ETFs tell part of the story. ChinaAMC, Bosera Hashkey, and Harvest have all gone dormant. [According to CoinDesk market data](https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/05/bitcoin-tests-usd80-000-as-asia-s-bid-fades-and-hong-kong"}}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1777955834627,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted"}}
